Package: harbour-radelt
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: armel
Maintainer: Sebastian Matkovich <sebastian.matkovich@gmail.com>
Depends: libqtcore4, libqtgui4, libqt4-network, libqt4-dbus, libqt4-declarative, libqtm-location, libmeegotouchcore0, qt-components
Section: user/other
Priority: optional
Aegis-Manifest: included
Description: Kilometres for Österreich radelt
 Records bicycle rides with the satellite receiver, keeps them on the phone
 as GPX, and sends the kilometres to the Österreich radelt platform. Rides
 can also be typed in by hand.
 .
 The MeeGo Harmattan edition: Qt 4.7 with com.nokia.meego instead of Silica,
 the same recording and upload core as the Sailfish edition.
Maemo-Display-Name: Radelt
XB-Maemo-Icon-26:
@ICON@
